<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><title>Starboards - Legendary Bot</title><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"/><link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png?v=10.0.0"/></head><body><div class="app-shell"><%- include("partials/sidebar") %><main class="main-content"><%- include("partials/topbar", { pageTitle: "Starboards", pageSubtitle: "Send popular starred messages to a starboard channel." }) %><% if (success) { %><div class="alert success"><%= success %></div><% } %><% if (error) { %><div class="alert error"><%= error %></div><% } %><section class="hero-card"><div class="hero-text"><div class="hero-icon-wrap"><img src="<%= botAvatar %>" class="hero-bot-avatar"/></div><div><h2>⭐ Starboard System</h2><p>When a message reaches the reaction threshold, the bot reposts it in your starboard channel.</p></div></div></section><section class="section-card"><div class="section-header"><h2>Settings</h2><p>Requires the bot to see reactions.</p></div><form method="POST" action="/starboards/save" class="form-stack padded-form"><label class="toggle-line"><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" <%= config.enabled ? "checked" : "" %>/><span>Enable Starboard</span></label><label class="form-group"><span>Starboard Channel</span><select name="starboardChannelId" class="input"><option value="">Select channel</option><% channelGroups.forEach(group => { %><optgroup label="📁 <%= group.name %>"><% group.channels.forEach(channel => { %><option value="<%= channel.id %>" <%= config.starboardChannelId === channel.id ? "selected" : "" %>># <%= channel.name %></option><% }) %></optgroup><% }) %></select></label><div class="mini-grid"><label class="form-group"><span>Emoji</span><input name="emoji" class="input" value="<%= config.emoji || '⭐' %>"/></label><label class="form-group"><span>Threshold</span><input name="threshold" type="number" min="1" class="input" value="<%= config.threshold || 3 %>"/></label></div><button class="primary-btn">Save Starboard</button></form></section></main></div><script src="/dashboard.js"></script><script src="/assets/js/site-music.js"></script></body></html>
